.TH KLVTOOL-VERSION 1 "1970-01-01" "klvtool dev" "User Commands"
.SH "NAME"
klvtool\-version \- Print the klvtool version, optionally checking GitHub for a newer release.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
klvtool version [\-\-check]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Print the embedded klvtool version. With \-\-check, query the GitHub API for the latest release tag and report whether the local build is current.
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-check\fR
check GitHub for a newer release
.SH "EXAMPLES"
Print the version
.RS 4
.nf
$ klvtool version
.fi
.RE
.PP
Check for a newer release
.RS 4
.nf
$ klvtool version --check
.fi
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
success (always — update\-check failures are reported but do not change exit code)
.TP
\fB2\fR
invalid usage
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBklvtool\fR(1),
\fBklvtool\-update\fR(1)
